{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那之後……", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯呼、嗯呼、真、真的夠了啦、很癢，而且很羞恥……」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6762", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們脫下衣服清理身體，然後躺到床上依偎彼此。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我溫柔地抱著紗凪，撫摸著她的頭。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──聊勝於無，倒也不是。", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然那樣說，但妳沒有抵抗呢，紗凪。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為不知道是被誰弄得神魂顛倒嘛。」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6763", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且新吾看起來很想摸的樣子……我是沒辦法才讓你摸的喔♪」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6764", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……反正很舒服，又很放鬆。」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6765", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……好痛痛痛！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6766", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……紗凪、該不會……」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉……感覺身體好像恢復力氣了，結果好像連那裡都想起來……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6767", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是我該說抱歉。」", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不用道歉沒關係。就像我剛才說的，這是我們都想做的事。」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6768", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女孩子的第一次會痛是自然的生理現象，沒辦法。」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6769", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，如果我沒有那麼激烈的話。", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我無法克制自己這樣想。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至少，在紗凪的痛楚痊癒之前，我絕對不能要求第二次……", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──不對。", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在紗凪開口要求之前我應該忍耐。我不能主動要求。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不能又失去理性，像野獸一樣……欺負紗凪……", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所～以～啊～你不必在意。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6770", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果你覺得男人只負責舒服很抱歉的話，與其道歉，那個……親……親我吧。」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6771", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯啾。」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼嗯、嗯嗯……！？啾、啾咕、嗯嗯、啾……啾姆、嗯嗯、嗯……唔唔……♪」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6772", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……太、太快了、笨蛋……嘿嘿嘿。」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6773", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……討厭嗎？」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又說那種話……哪可能討厭嘛，應該說──」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6774", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果我會那樣想，那個……就、就不會把女孩子重要的東西給你了。」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6775", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪……嗯。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯、啾……嗯呼、嗯呼、又親我了……啾咕、嗯啾、啾、啾。」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6776", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……嗯♪」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6777", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴唇才剛分開，紗凪就笑得一臉開心，蹭了蹭我的臉。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……剛才那樣的，還要做更多更多……」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6778", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以嗎……？」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然害羞，可是能感覺到被珍惜……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6779", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，請讓我珍惜妳。」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿……今天就特別吧……♪」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6780", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然已經跨夜了。」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……欸、啊、真的耶！？」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6781", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖、雖然我沒資格說這個，不過新吾不回去沒關係嘛？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6782", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼可能放著這麼可愛的女朋友回去。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哈、唔。」", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6783", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那樣說也、那個、很好……還要聽……」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6784", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃今天也會住在瀨名同學家，所以不用在意時間沒關係。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是這樣啊……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6785", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那、那麼，乾脆……那個、新吾願意的話……」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6786", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到早上……都在一起吧……？」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6787", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我猶豫了一秒。", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是紗凪的眼神中散發著強烈的希望。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果妳乖乖睡覺的話。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「睡睡睡！一、一起睡覺對吧！？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6788", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……當然。」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，沒問題。我能忍得住。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不會再失去理性了。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……居然能跟新吾一起睡覺，今天真的發生好多第一次……」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6789", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就說已經跨夜了。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用管那種細節啦，到睡著醒來之前都算今天。」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6790", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為是平安夜，所以全部都是被允許的。」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6791", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……在紗凪心中，平安夜似乎是有魔法的樣子。", "text_idx": 128, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以說，想要更多、更多新吾♪」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6792", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳根本就不想睡吧？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀！」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6793", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉，因為紗凪太可愛了。」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為是平安夜，所以原諒你……♪」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6794", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、好痛痛痛。」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6795", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……為了能盡量減緩疼痛，不管幾次……我會溫柔的。」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯♪給我很多禮物吧……？」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6796", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然那種眼神很可愛……不過，現在閉上眼睛吧？」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……啾、啾♪」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6797", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿嘿……感覺光是今天，就超過以前加起來親親的次數了……♪」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6798", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在各種意義上都是一輩子難忘的夜晚……嘿嘿、欸嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6799", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾呢？跟我一樣……一輩子都忘不了今晚嗎？」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6800", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼可能忘記。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──沒錯，在各種意義上今天都是讓人無法忘記的一天。", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不可能忘記。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈……太好了！把新吾迷得神魂顛倒～♪」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6801", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯呼、嗯優嗯優嗯優……哈～太高興了、太幸福了……」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6802", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "笑著這麼說的紗凪真的好可愛、好惹人憐愛。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我抱緊她，一次又一次地親吻、撫摸頭髮取悅她。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……♪呵呵、呵呵呵、嗯優嗯優嗯優～」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": "sn6803", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是紗凪的身體便親密地貼上來，像在要求『更多』……", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在直到天亮為止的短暫時間中，我們依偎著彼此入睡了……", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
